Problem: Activity Rank
Platform: StrataScratch | Difficulty: Medium
Window Function Used: ROW_NUMBER()
Key Logic: Count emails sent per user, ROW_NUMBER ordered by count desc then username asc to break ties alphabetically

-- SOLUTION
SELECT
    from_user AS user,
    COUNT(*) AS total_emails,
    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC, from_user ASC) AS activity_rank
FROM google_gmail_emails
GROUP BY from_user
ORDER BY total_emails DESC, user ASC;
